X:1
T:Earth Angel
C:Curtis Williams, Gaynel Hodge and Jesse Belvin, 1954
N:Best-effort version, not verified against a second source. Melody is the
N:lead line of a doo-wop arrangement MIDI (hamienet.com), moved up an octave
N:to fit the recorder and quantized to sixteenths, so the triplet feel of
N:the original shows as uneven sixteenths. Chords come from that
N:arrangement's piano. One pass is the 32-bar chorus (A A B A).
